.SH "نام (NAME)"
localsearch-inhibit \- Inhibit indexing temporarily
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBlocalsearch inhibit\fR <\fIcommand\fR> \fBlocalsearch inhibit\fR [\-\-list | \-l]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBlocalsearch inhibit\fR pauses the LocalSearch indexer while \fIcommand\fR is running\&.
.sp
If called with the \fB\-\-list\fR option\&. The existing reasons to have the indexer paused will be listed\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBlocalsearch\-status\fR(1), \fBlocalsearch\-3\fR(1)\&.
